Z||000006||Phaeton||05-23-2000||05:24 AM||||High powered Vista Cruiser's make my eyes shiny. sniff honk<P>The ex took my cruiser in the divorce. open weeping<P>But I kept the Fiero and three kids, what a combo!  Life is interesting.<P>Oh yeah, the kids need some milk, gotta run to town.<P>Dang, thinking about driving made me space what this post was about.<P>It'll come back to me, I'm sure.  Meanwhile it is a six mile drive to town and the Fiero has new driving lights.<P>Happy Trails.<P>And speaking of Trails, no matter how much distance has been traveled down a bad trail, turning around and going the other way will eventually lead to the road turned off from.<P>Turned off?  Turned off?   AAAACK  My tea water!!||||reg||12
